# Kronos Code - K2 API Configuration
#
# Primary: set the `kronosCode.k2ApiKey` setting in VS Code Settings
# (Settings UI or settings.json). This is the recommended, zero-build-step way
# to configure your key and takes precedence over the environment variable.
#
# Fallback: if `kronosCode.k2ApiKey` is empty, Kronos reads K2_API_KEY from
# the environment below. Copy this file to .env and fill in your key if you
# prefer this route (e.g. for local development builds).

K2_API_KEY=your-k2-api-key-here
